# Possibility Technician cast for its warp cost {1}{R}: Jet and Pearl alone (no red) can't pay it. It enters and exiles the top card of
# Bot1's library, Mox Sapphire (Bot2's library is untouched). At the end step warp exiles the Technician, so Bot1 controls no Kavu and may
# not play the Mox, though it is free (the permission outlasts the Technician but needs a Kavu). On turn 3 Molecular Modifier (a Kavu)
# enters and Bot1 may play the Mox. (Modifier's own entry exiles nothing: the Technician is in exile, not on the battlefield.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Possibility Technician
Molecular Modifier
Island x2
Mox Sapphire
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Possibility Technician.Cast(Ability: Warp; Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Possibility Technician.Cast(Ability: Warp)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = {B}
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Exile.Mox Sapphire.Colors.Count = 0
? Bot2.Library.Count = 13
[T1 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Ruby
? Bot1.Exile.Possibility Technician.Colors.Count = 1
! Bot1.Exile.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Molecular Modifier.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Exile.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Ruby; Mox Sapphire; Molecular Modifier
